cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this renderer in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "ray_tracer: a pbrt-v4-compatible path tracer for CPU, NVIDIA OptiX and Apple Metal"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Xinpei
repository-code: "https://github.com/XinpeiWang/ray_tracer"
url: "https://xinpeiwang.github.io/ray_tracer/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ray tracing
  - path tracing
  - physically based rendering
  - pbrt
  - OptiX
  - Metal
  - computer graphics
abstract: >-
  A physically based renderer that reads pbrt-v4 scene files and renders them on the CPU, on NVIDIA GPUs through OptiX and on Apple GPUs through Metal,
  with a Qt GUI, a Scene Builder and an interactive Live Preview. Its renders are checked against closed-form results and by rendering the same scene two ways.
